{"title":"工具 - Rust 程序设计语言","description":"一门帮助每个人构建可靠且高效软件的语言。","html":"<header class=\"mt3 mt2-ns mb4 mb5-ns tc tl-ns\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <h1>工具</h1>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section id=\"tools-write\" class=\"green\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>\n        主流编辑器支持\n      </h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight highlight-yellow\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <br>\n    <div class=\"tools-row\">\n      <div id=\"tools-write-ide-prose\">\n      <p>\n无论您喜欢用命令行还是可视化编辑器，都有适合的 Rust 集成供您选择。\n您也可以使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-analyzer\">rust-analyzer</a> 来为自己的编辑器添加 Rust 支持。      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex-none flex-m flex-l flex-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/languages/rust\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">VS Code</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rust.vim\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">Vim/Neovim</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://jetbrains.com/rust\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">RustRover</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://rust-analyzer.github.io/book/other_editors.html#helix\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">Helix</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-mode\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">Emacs</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-enhanced\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">Sublime Text</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://rust-analyzer.github.io/book/other_editors.html#visual-studio-2022\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">Visual Studio</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-25-l w-50-m w-100 pa3\">\n        <a href=\"https://zed.dev/docs/languages/rust\"\n           class=\"button button-secondary\">Zed</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"tools-build\" class=\"purple\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>\n        流畅的构建体验\n      </h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight highlight-red\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <p>\n      Cargo 是 Rust 的构建工具，它将常用命令集于一身，无需引入其它命令。\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"flex-none flex-l flex-row\">\n      <div class=\"mt2 w-100\" id=\"packages\">\n        <h3 class=\"code-header\">\n          安装\n        </h3>\n        <p>\n          <a href=\"https://crates.io\">crates.io</a> 上拥有成千上万的软件包，您想要的解决方案在这里几乎都能找到。\n站在巨人的肩膀上，您的团队可远离重复，专注创新。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt2 w-100 ml5-l\" id=\"linting\">\n        <h3 class=\"code-header\">\n          测试\n        </h3>\n        <p>\n          Rust 出色的测试工具能让您对代码放心。<code class=\"nowrap\">cargo test</code>\n是 Rust 统一的测试方案。测试代码既可写在功能代码之后，也可放在独立文件中，它满足您所有的测试需求。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt2 w-100 ml5-l\" id=\"deployment\">\n        <h3 class=\"code-header\">\n          部署\n        </h3>\n        <p>\n          <code class=\"nowrap\">cargo build</code>\n可为不同平台构建精益的可执行文件。仅需一行命令，您的代码就能针对\nWindows、Linux、macOS 和 Web 进行编译。支持全部现代平台接口，无需定制构建文件。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"tools-debug\" class=\"red\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>\n        利用自动化加速开发\n      </h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight highlight-red\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <br>\n    <p>\n      Rust 的工业级工具能够让团队无惧协作，专注于重要的任务。\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"flex-none flex-l flex-row\">\n      <div class=\"mt5 mt2-l flex flex-column w-100\">\n        <h3 class=\"code-header\">\n          Rustfmt\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"flex-grow-1\">\n          Rustfmt 用于自动格式化 Rust 代码，使代码更加容易阅读、编写和维护。最重要的一点是：您再也不必为空格或大括号位置而争论了。\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rustfmt\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary\">前往源码库</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt5 mt2-l flex flex-column w-100 ml5-l\">\n        <h3 class=\"code-header\">\n          Clippy\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"flex-grow-1\">\n          <b>“您似乎正在编写一个迭代器。”</b><br>\nClippy 能够帮助所有不同经验水平的开发者编写出符合惯例的代码及推行标准写法。\n        </p>\n         <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rust-clippy\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary\">前往源码库</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt5 mt2-l flex flex-column w-100 ml5-l\">\n        <h3 class=\"code-header\">\n          Cargo Doc\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"flex-grow-1\">\n          Cargo 文档构建器让所有 API 都有文档。\n您可以通过 <code class=\"nowrap\">cargo doc</code> 在本地生成文档，\n还可以通过 <a href=\"https://docs.rs\">docs.rs</a> 在线获取公开的 crate 文档。\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://docs.rs/\"\n             class=\"button button-secondary\">前往站点</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"}